hor as all writers tend to choose only words from some defined subset of the Vocabulary. Also, the out of vocabulary words, generally the spelling mistakes done by the author, depict the style of the writing text, and therefore, comes to be an important aspect of the solution. The solution, thus, comes to be finding the total probability of each Ngram to be written by the particular author in the email.","topics":[],"score":259337,"global_rank":50528,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9345},{"name":"harvimt/steam_launcher","owner":"harvimt","html_url":"https://github.com/harvimt/steam_launcher","stars":5,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259322,"global_rank":50546,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9346},{"name":"JeremyGrosser/ccs2ada","owner":"JeremyGrosser","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyGrosser/ccs2ada","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"TI device definitions to Ada package specifications","topics":[],"score":259319,"global_rank":50551,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9347},{"name":"kehrl/big3","owner":"kehrl","html_url":"https://github.com/kehrl/big3","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Scripts and libraries for investigating changes in ice dynamics at Helheim and Kangerlussuaq Glaciers, SE Greenland, using satellite observations and numerical models.","topics":["fortran","python"],"score":259312,"global_rank":50556,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9348},{"name":"jdegregorio/rl-kuiper-escape","owner":"jdegregorio","html_url":"https://github.com/jdegregorio/rl-kuiper-escape","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A project to  build an AI player for custom game (Kuiper Escape) using reinforcement learning (RL) algorithms.","topics":["game","machine-learning","open-ai-gym","pygame","reinforcement-learning"],"score":259304,"g